---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { REPO } from '../lib/links';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy — SyntheticPen" description="SyntheticPen privacy policy. No data collected, no telemetry, no network calls.">
  <main class="container" style="padding: 80px 32px; max-width: 820px;">
    <h1 style="font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 52px);">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p style="color: var(--silver); margin-top: 8px; font-size: 14px;">
      Effective date: 15 May 2026
    </p>

    <p style="color: var(--silver); margin-top: 24px;">
      SyntheticPen ("the application", "we", "us") is a Windows desktop application
      that replays vector geometry as synthetic pen and cursor input. This policy
      explains what information the application does and does not handle.
    </p>

    <p style="color: var(--silver); margin-top: 16px;">
      <strong>Summary: SyntheticPen does not collect, transmit, or store any
      personal data.</strong> It runs entirely on your device. There is no
      telemetry, no analytics, no advertising, no account, and no network
      communication of any kind.
    </p>

    <h2 style="margin-top: 40px;">Information we collect</h2>
    <p style="color: var(--silver);">
      None. SyntheticPen does not collect or process personal information,
      usage data, device identifiers, location, or contacts. It does not create
      a user account and does not require sign-in.
    </p>

    <h2 style="margin-top: 32px;">Local files and settings</h2>
    <p style="color: var(--silver);">
      Any SVGs or motion profiles you open are read from your computer and
      remain on your computer. Application settings are stored locally in your
      Windows user profile under <code>%APPDATA%\SyntheticPen</code>. These
      files never leave your device and are not transmitted to us or any third
      party. You may delete them at any time.
    </p>
    <p style="color: var(--silver); margin-top: 16px;">
      When diagnostics are enabled in development builds, the application may
      write log files to a local <code>debug</code> folder for troubleshooting.
      Release builds distributed through the Microsoft Store do not write
      diagnostic logs, and no logs are ever sent off the device.
    </p>

    <h2 style="margin-top: 32px;">Network use</h2>
    <p style="color: var(--silver);">
      SyntheticPen makes no network connections. It does not contact our
      servers or any external service during installation or use.
    </p>

    <h2 style="margin-top: 32px;">This website</h2>
    <p style="color: var(--silver);">
      Everything above describes the desktop <em>application</em>. This
      website (syntheticpen.com) is separate and uses
      <strong>Cloudflare Web Analytics</strong> to count visits. It is
      cookieless, sets no identifiers, does not fingerprint or track you
      across sites, and collects no personal data — only aggregate page
      metrics. The application itself still makes no network calls.
    </p>

    <h2 style="margin-top: 32px;">Third parties</h2>
    <p style="color: var(--silver);">
      We do not share information with third parties because we do not collect
      any. The application integrates no third-party analytics, advertising, or
      tracking SDKs. Distribution and updates are handled by the Microsoft
      Store under Microsoft's own privacy terms.
    </p>

    <h2 style="margin-top: 32px;">Children's privacy</h2>
    <p style="color: var(--silver);">
      SyntheticPen does not collect personal information from anyone, including
      children, and is not directed at children.
    </p>

    <h2 style="margin-top: 32px;">Data security</h2>
    <p style="color: var(--silver);">
      Because no data is collected or transmitted, there is no personal data in
      our custody to secure. Files you create or load are protected by your own
      operating system's file permissions.
    </p>

    <h2 style="margin-top: 32px;">Your rights</h2>
    <p style="color: var(--silver);">
      Since we hold no personal data about you, there is nothing for us to
      access, correct, export, or delete on your behalf. You retain full
      control of every file the application reads or writes on your device.
    </p>

    <h2 style="margin-top: 32px;">Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p style="color: var(--silver);">
      If this policy changes, the updated version will be posted on this page
      with a revised effective date. Material changes will also be noted in the
      project's release notes.
    </p>

    <h2 style="margin-top: 32px;">Contact</h2>
    <p style="color: var(--silver);">
      Questions about this policy can be raised by opening an issue on the
      project's GitHub repository:
      <a href={REPO} style="color: var(--silver);">{REPO}</a>.
    </p>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
